1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,000
The eye is following my face.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,400
The gaze is not on a timer.
It is tracking me live.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:10,000
One round LCD, one AI camera,
one Teensy 4.1.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,600
The camera detects the face itself.
No Pi, no PC in the loop.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,200
It sends the face center over UART.
Modbus RTU, 9600 baud.

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,800
The Teensy maps that to a gaze target.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,200
Blinking, pupil dilation and saccades
are all autonomous.

8
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:27,600
With no face in frame,
it wanders on its own.

9
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:31,000
Gaze range and gate tune live
over serial. No reflash.

10
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,200
Built because my robot face's sensor
was discontinued.

11
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:38,500
This one drops in unchanged.
It is in IRIS now, tracking live.
